          "narration": "Night after night, Mars drifts eastward \u2014 to the left on this view of the sky \u2014 leaving a trail as it moves. This normal prograde motion is easy to understand: Mars is simply orbiting the Sun in the same direction as Earth, but more slowly. The trail you see represents weeks of observation."
